Printing is a proficiency in the Crafting tab focusing on Paper, Books, Schematics and Scrolls. It is the best way to get access to rare Schematics like Seabreeze Designs or a Monster Sonar Design. It is also required to craft Regrade Scrolls of any kind.

=== Craftings ===

==== Paper ====
Paper and Blank Regrade Scrolls are two of the main ingredients in the Printing proficiency.{{RecipeRow|2841|5622}}
==== Schematics ====
There are a lot of designs for ship components needed to upgrade ships. The designs can be acquired by opening {{Item|ItemID=36006}}, {{Item|ItemID=36005}}, and {{Item|ItemID=36004}}, but Seabreeze Designs and Sea Monster Sonar Designs are rather rare, so an item called {{Item|ItemID=9000163}} has been added to craft those designs. Crafting rare designs requires proficiency to exceed 180,000.

The {{Item|ItemID=9000163}} can be acquired by using an {{Item|ItemID=19812}} on any kind of Component Schematic, returning 1 Scrap per Design.
{{RecipeRow|9000309|9000263|9000277}}

==== Enlightenment Forging ====
Enchantment Scrolls are used to enchant Ayanad and other special accessories into their enlightened versions. While all of these items require {{Item|ItemID=9002090|amount=1}}, {{Item|ItemID=31927|amount=1}}, and {{Item|ItemID=16358|amount=5}}, some of them also require an already-crafted Divine accessory to even be created. Below is an example of each kind.
